      "body": "<h2>Out of the darkness</h2><p>The lantern is found on a dead bearer. Sombra attunes to it, and the company brings it outside.</p><h2>A name remembered</h2><p>Luxcit identifies itself as a minor archon of Cala and names its previous Lightbringer Harlan Rayburn. It asks that he be honoured by fighting evil.</p>",
