      "body": "<h2>A practical consequence</h2><p>Earlier purchases prioritise beds, rugs, plates and cookware. By this visit, the hostel has fresh linens, pillows and flowers.</p><h2>Work still to do</h2><p>Chayma continues to face the difficulty of attracting steady guests. The improvements help a livelihood; they do not resolve all the city’s pressures.</p>",
