      "body": "<h2>A difficult ascent</h2><p>The company reaches the glacier after a dangerous climb. When Espera slips, her companions hold the rope until she regains her grip.</p><h2>Choosing a side</h2><p>They aid the freedom-seeking group against its opponents. Zrurg thanks them and describes the struggle against an oppressive ruler; Blotlox brings a reward.</p><h2>The war continues</h2><p>The encounter is won, but the tyrant is not shown defeated. The kobolds ask for further help.</p>",
